/drive.google.com/drive/folders/1d9HUBH3drazjzUrlNoM_JiFPUxwrvSdg?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kngegt/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8c2cfae5/uploads/origins/65bd1db0-b2dc-4bcc-9adc-487687ebd6ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48296887c9b7851fdf0c9e03992465cb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8c2cfae5/uploads/origins/65bd1db0-b2dc-4bcc-9adc-487687ebd6ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48296887c9b7851fdf0c9e03992465cb, https://si.imgix.net/8c2cfae5/uploads/origins/65bd1db0-b2dc-4bcc-9adc-487687ebd6ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d21725f39fc0622ee8f0ca6f751caac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8c2cfae5/uploads/origins/65bd1db0-b2dc-4bcc-9adc-487687ebd6ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab1fd5628e6b3b157c82fafd53b943de 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエスト失礼します。よければお願いします！\nわたしのキャラクターの服デザインよろしいでしょうか。\n\nくろ・しろが好きだから！\nふたりの要素：カメラ、映画、シアター、ブラックホール、星。\nなにか失礼がありましたら申し訳ありません。よろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LBbvkOWL0U_7kPWipFCKGzo_r9Gfg87v?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1a3sn40yrgeqjt0k_4JPWJUkekQDYYWi5?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kngegt/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/46b46662/uploads/origins/c62ae673-e484-42c9-917e-0d2a354ced07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bface14c59114e9d8da6378de769599", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/46b46662/uploads/origins/c62ae673-e484-42c9-917e-0d2a354ced07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bface14c59114e9d8da6378de769599, https://si.imgix.net/46b46662/uploads/origins/c62ae673-e484-42c9-917e-0d2a354ced07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e3e609c4d06ebc4d837020485c9c7b2